<title>USA: PanEnergy Coro unit to redeem debentures.</title>
<headline>PanEnergy Coro unit to redeem debentures.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PanEnergy Corp's Texas Eastern Transmission Corp said Friday it would redeem its 10-1/8 percent debentures due September 1, 2011, and its 10 percent debentures due October 1, 2011.</p>
<p>The redemption price for the 10-1/8 percent debentures is 105.062 percent of the principal amount, with interest accrued to the October 1, 1996, redemption date.</p>
<p>The 10 percent debentures will be redeemed at 105.00 percent of the principal amount.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
